These directories contain the browser plugins to enable Java 1.4.x support on
Mac OS X from a non-Cocoa app. The project has a MPL-compatible license and the
source is hosted on SourceForge.

ZoolRunner's Mac OS X 10.0 target does not package these prebuilt plugins:
their PowerPC binaries use two-level Mach-O namespaces, unavailable in 10.0,
and depend on the later Java runtime. The platform's OJI/NPAPI interfaces and
the bundled plugins for other applicable targets remain available.

For more information on the Java Embedding Plugin project, visit:
  
  http://javaplugin.sourceforget.net/

The current version of the plugin is 0.9.3. Contact Steven Michaud 
(smichaud at pobox.com) for questions or issues.
